{"seq":1,"slug":"viewmodel","title":"ViewModel 视图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/viewmodel","wordCount":646,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"viewmodel-视图模型\">ViewModel 视图模型</h1><p>ViewModel 是 Android Jetpack 架构组件的核心，负责以生命周期感知的方式管理和存储 UI 相关数据。它在配置变更（如屏幕旋转）时存活，避免数据重复加载和内存泄漏。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ViewModel 围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生命周期感知</strong>：ViewModel 绑定到 ViewModelStoreOwner（Activity/Fragment），但存活更久——配置变更时保留实例，只有 owner 真正 finish 时才触发 <code>onCleared()</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>SavedStateHandle</code></strong>：键值对存储，让 ViewModel 在进程死亡后也能恢复状态，容量受 Bundle 限制（约 500KB）。</li>\n<li><strong>跨屏幕数据共享</strong>：以 Activity 为 ViewModelStoreOwner 获取同一实例，多个 Fragment/Composable 即可通过它通信。</li>\n<li><strong>可测试性</strong>：业务逻辑独立于 Android 框架，可用纯 JVM 单元测试验证，依赖通过 Fake/Mock 替换。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期感知\">生命周期感知</h2><p>ViewModel 的生命周期与创建它的 ViewModelStoreOwner（通常是 Activity 或 Fragment）绑定，但比 Activity/Fragment 的生命周期更长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Activity onCreate] --&gt; B[创建或获取 ViewModel]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Activity 运行中]&#10;    C --&gt; D[屏幕旋转]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Activity onDestroy]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Activity onCreate 重建]&#10;    F --&gt; G[获取同一 ViewModel 实例]&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; H[用户按返回键]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Activity onDestroy finish]&#10;    I --&gt; J[ViewModel onCleared]&#10;&#10;    classDef vmAlive stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B,C,D,E,F,G vmAlive\">graph TD\n    A[Activity onCreate] --&gt; B[创建或获取 ViewModel]\n    B --&gt; C[Activity 运行中]\n    C --&gt; D[屏幕旋转]\n    D --&gt; E[Activity onDestroy]\n    E --&gt; F[Activity onCreate 重建]\n    F --&gt; G[获取同一 ViewModel 实例]\n    G --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; H[用户按返回键]\n    H --&gt; I[Activity onDestroy finish]\n    I --&gt; J[ViewModel onCleared]\n\n    classDef vmAlive stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B,C,D,E,F,G vmAlive</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class UserProfileViewModel(&#10;    private val userRepository: UserRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(UserProfileUiState())&#10;    val uiState: StateFlow&lt;UserProfileUiState&gt; = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    init {&#10;        loadUserProfile()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun loadUserProfile() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }&#10;            userRepository.getCurrentUser()&#10;                .onSuccess { user -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update {&#10;                        it.copy(user = user, isLoading = false)&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;                .onFailure { error -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update {&#10;                        it.copy(errorMessage = error.message, isLoading = false)&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override fun onCleared() {&#10;        super.onCleared()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class UserProfileUiState(&#10;    val user: User? = null,&#10;    val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;    val errorMessage: String? = null&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class UserProfileViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val userRepository: UserRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(UserProfileUiState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState: StateFlow&#x3C;UserProfileUiState> = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    init {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadUserProfile()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun loadUserProfile() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            userRepository.getCurrentUser()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onSuccess { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        it.copy(user = user, isLoading = false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onFailure { error -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        it.copy(errorMessage = error.message, isLoading = false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCleared() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCleared()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class UserProfileUiState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val user: User? = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val errorMessage: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ViewModel 事件</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>典型操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构造函数 / <code>init</code></td>\n<td>首次创建时</td>\n<td>加载初始数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常运行</td>\n<td>Activity/Fragment 活跃时</td>\n<td>响应 UI 事件、管理数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onCleared()</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 即将销毁</td>\n<td>取消资源（自动由 <code>viewModelScope</code> 处理）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"savedstatehandle\">SavedStateHandle</h2><p><code>SavedStateHandle</code> 让 ViewModel 能在进程死亡后恢复状态，它本质上是一个键值对存储。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SearchViewModel(&#10;    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle,&#10;    private val searchRepository: SearchRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    val searchQuery = savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(&quot;query&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;    val searchResults = searchQuery&#10;        .debounce(300)&#10;        .filter { it.length &gt;= 2 }&#10;        .flatMapLatest { query -&gt;&#10;            searchRepository.search(query)&#10;        }&#10;        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), emptyList())&#10;&#10;    fun updateQuery(query: String) {&#10;        savedStateHandle[&quot;query&quot;] = query&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val selectedFilters: StateFlow&lt;Set&lt;String&gt;&gt; =&#10;        savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(&quot;filters&quot;, emptySet())&#10;&#10;    fun toggleFilter(filter: String) {&#10;        val current = savedStateHandle.get&lt;Set&lt;String&gt;&gt;(&quot;filters&quot;) ?: emptySet()&#10;        savedStateHandle[&quot;filters&quot;] = if (filter in current) current - filter else current + filter&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val searchRepository: SearchRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val searchQuery = savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(\"query\", \"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val searchResults = searchQuery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .debounce(300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter { it.length >= 2 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .flatMapLatest { query -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            searchRepository.search(query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun updateQuery(query: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        savedStateHandle[\"query\"] = query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val selectedFilters: StateFlow&#x3C;Set&#x3C;String>> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(\"filters\", emptySet())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun toggleFilter(filter: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val current = savedStateHandle.get&#x3C;Set&#x3C;String>>(\"filters\") ?: emptySet()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        savedStateHandle[\"filters\"] = if (filter in current) current - filter else current + filter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>存活范围</th>\n<th>数据大小</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ViewModel 属性</td>\n<td>配置变更</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>网络请求结果、缓存数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SavedStateHandle</code></td>\n<td>配置变更 + 进程死亡</td>\n<td>~500KB</td>\n<td>搜索关键字、滚动位置、选中状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room / DataStore</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>用户设置、离线数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>SavedStateHandle.getStateFlow()</code> 返回的 StateFlow 在值被更新时自动通知观察者，无需手动设置监听。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据共享\">数据共享</h2><p>多个 Fragment 或 Composable 可以通过共享 ViewModel 来通信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class SharedCartViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val cartRepository: CartRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _cartItems = MutableStateFlow&lt;List&lt;CartItem&gt;&gt;(emptyList())&#10;    val cartItems = _cartItems.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    val totalPrice = cartItems.map { items -&gt;&#10;        items.sumOf { it.price * it.quantity }&#10;    }.stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), 0.0)&#10;&#10;    val itemCount = cartItems.map { it.size }&#10;        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), 0)&#10;&#10;    fun addItem(product: Product) {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch { cartRepository.addToCart(product) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun removeItem(itemId: String) {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch { cartRepository.removeFromCart(itemId) }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductScreen(&#10;    sharedCartViewModel: SharedCartViewModel = hiltViewModel(&#10;        viewModelStoreOwner = LocalContext.current as ComponentActivity&#10;    )&#10;) {&#10;    val itemCount by sharedCartViewModel.itemCount.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;    // Activity 级别的共享 ViewModel&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SharedCartViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cartRepository: CartRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _cartItems = MutableStateFlow&#x3C;List&#x3C;CartItem>>(emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cartItems = _cartItems.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val totalPrice = cartItems.map { items -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items.sumOf { it.price * it.quantity }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), 0.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val itemCount = cartItems.map { it.size }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun addItem(product: Product) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch { cartRepository.addToCart(product) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun removeItem(itemId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch { cartRepository.removeFromCart(itemId) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sharedCartViewModel: SharedCartViewModel = hiltViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelStoreOwner = LocalContext.current as ComponentActivity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val itemCount by sharedCartViewModel.itemCount.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Activity 级别的共享 ViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Activity ViewModel Store] --&gt; B[SharedCartViewModel]&#10;    C[ProductListScreen] --&gt; B&#10;    D[CartScreen] --&gt; B&#10;    E[CheckoutScreen] --&gt; B&#10;&#10;    classDef vmStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B vmStyle\">graph TD\n    A[Activity ViewModel Store] --&gt; B[SharedCartViewModel]\n    C[ProductListScreen] --&gt; B\n    D[CartScreen] --&gt; B\n    E[CheckoutScreen] --&gt; B\n\n    classDef vmStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B vmStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"hilt-集成\">Hilt 集成</h2><p>Hilt 简化了 ViewModel 的依赖注入，通过 <code>@HiltViewModel</code> 和 <code>@Inject</code> 注解自动提供依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class OrderViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val orderRepository: OrderRepository,&#10;    private val analyticsTracker: AnalyticsTracker,&#10;    savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val orderId: String = checkNotNull(savedStateHandle[&quot;orderId&quot;])&#10;&#10;    val order = orderRepository.getOrderById(orderId)&#10;        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), null)&#10;&#10;    fun cancelOrder() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            orderRepository.cancelOrder(orderId)&#10;            analyticsTracker.trackEvent(&quot;order_cancelled&quot;, mapOf(&quot;orderId&quot; to orderId))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun OrderDetailScreen(viewModel: OrderViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {&#10;    val order by viewModel.order.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;    // UI 代码&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val orderRepository: OrderRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val analyticsTracker: AnalyticsTracker,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val orderId: String = checkNotNull(savedStateHandle[\"orderId\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val order = orderRepository.getOrderById(orderId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .stateIn(viewModelScope, SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000), null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun cancelOrder() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            orderRepository.cancelOrder(orderId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            analyticsTracker.trackEvent(\"order_cancelled\", mapOf(\"orderId\" to orderId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun OrderDetailScreen(viewModel: OrderViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val order by viewModel.order.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // UI 代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试\">测试</h2><p>ViewModel 的业务逻辑独立于 Android 框架，可以通过纯 JVM 单元测试进行验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SearchViewModelTest {&#10;&#10;    @get:Rule&#10;    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()&#10;&#10;    private lateinit var viewModel: SearchViewModel&#10;    private val fakeRepository = FakeSearchRepository()&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        viewModel = SearchViewModel(&#10;            savedStateHandle = SavedStateHandle(),&#10;            searchRepository = fakeRepository&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `updateQuery updates savedStateHandle and triggers search`() = runTest {&#10;        viewModel.updateQuery(&quot;Kotlin&quot;)&#10;&#10;        val results = viewModel.searchResults.first()&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;Kotlin&quot;, viewModel.searchQuery.value)&#10;        assertTrue(results.isNotEmpty())&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `short query does not trigger search`() = runTest {&#10;        viewModel.updateQuery(&quot;K&quot;)&#10;&#10;        advanceUntilIdle()&#10;        val results = viewModel.searchResults.value&#10;        assertTrue(results.isEmpty())&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModelTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @get:Rule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val mainDispatcherRule = MainDispatcherRule()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var viewModel: SearchViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeRepository = FakeSearchRepository()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel = SearchViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            savedStateHandle = SavedStateHandle(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            searchRepository = fakeRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `updateQuery updates savedStateHandle and triggers search`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.updateQuery(\"Kotlin\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val results = viewModel.searchResults.first()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"Kotlin\", viewModel.searchQuery.value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(results.isNotEmpty())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `short query does not trigger search`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModel.updateQuery(\"K\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceUntilIdle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val results = viewModel.searchResults.value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertTrue(results.isEmpty())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试要素</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主线程调度器</td>\n<td><code>MainDispatcherRule</code></td>\n<td>替换 <code>Dispatchers.Main</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协程测试</td>\n<td><code>runTest</code></td>\n<td>控制协程时间流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖替换</td>\n<td>Fake / Mock 实现</td>\n<td>隔离外部依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flow 测试</td>\n<td>Turbine</td>\n<td>验证 Flow 发射序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 测试中使用 <code>advanceUntilIdle()</code> 确保所有挂起的协程都执行完毕，避免测试不稳定。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ViewModel 在配置变更时存活，避免数据重复加载</li>\n<li><code>SavedStateHandle</code> 在进程死亡后恢复关键 UI 状态</li>\n<li>通过 Activity 级别的 ViewModel 实现跨屏幕数据共享</li>\n<li><code>@HiltViewModel</code> + <code>@Inject</code> 简化依赖注入</li>\n<li>ViewModel 的业务逻辑可以通过纯 JVM 单元测试验证</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ViewModel 视图模型","id":"viewmodel-视图模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期感知","id":"生命周期感知"},{"level":2,"text":"SavedStateHandle","id":"savedstatehandle"},{"level":2,"text":"数据共享","id":"数据共享"},{"level":2,"text":"Hilt 集成","id":"hilt-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"测试","id":"测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/animation"},"next":{"title":"Room 数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/room-database"}}